https://github.com/clash-verge-rev/clash-verge-rev

This repository:
https://github.com/ma906584241/clash-verge-rev

CraftVPN is not an official Clash Verge, Clash Verge Rev, or clash-verge-rev
release, and it is not affiliated with those projects. It is also not the
Android application named Craft VPN published by TrafCraft LLC.

The program is released under the GNU General Public License v3.0 only. The
original LICENSE file and the original copyright notices in the source are
retained. See LICENSE.

In-app updates are disabled. This build does not use Clash Verge update
servers, third-party mirrors of those servers, or the upstream minisign
public key. A placeholder public key that matches no published artifact is
compiled in instead. Do not turn updates on until this repository hosts its
own update metadata and a key generated for CraftVPN.

The icons and wordmark under src-tauri/icons and src/assets/image are
original placeholders. Replace them with your own artwork. They are not
Clash Verge artwork.

The Windows application id is io.github.ma906584241.craftvpn. The installed
product name is CraftVPN. The deep-link scheme is craftvpn://.
